    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build decks and engage in battles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 8 playable characters, unlocked as the game progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Over 200 available cards, offering flexible and varied deck building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Rich main story and side content, with a total playtime of 30-50 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 A wide variety of imaginative enemies and powerful bosses await your challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track the cause of the events and uncover the truth of the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Explore JingHai City across different time loops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Spend this unusual autumn with important companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Deepen the bonds between each other as the story progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422590/extras/587a28b407d78cb5e25d20d367a07beb.avif?t=1755248105\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful enemies that transcend reality together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422590/extras/79561716b93e433892d0942cbbfb8ee0.poster.avif?t=1755248105\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422590/extras/79561716b93e433892d0942cbbfb8ee0.webm?t=1755248105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422590/extras/79561716b93e433892d0942cbbfb8ee0.mp4?t=1755248105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The endless pursuit in the endgame</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00b7 Collect and strengthen your deck, adjust team strategies, head to key locations in JingHai City and engage in endless battles to protect the city's future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget to relax and enjoy daily life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Between adventures, don't miss the chance to experience the relaxing daily life. Mystery games from the pixel era, challenging score competitions... more casual gameplay awaits your participation.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build decks and engage in battles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 8 playable characters, unlocked as the game progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Over 200 available cards, offering flexible and varied deck building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Rich main story and side content, with a total playtime of 30-50 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 A wide variety of imaginative enemies and powerful bosses await your challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track the cause of the events and uncover the truth of the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Explore JingHai City across different time loops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Spend this unusual autumn with important companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Deepen the bonds between each other as the story progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422590/extras/587a28b407d78cb5e25d20d367a07beb.avif?t=1755248105\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful enemies that transcend reality together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422590/extras/79561716b93e433892d0942cbbfb8ee0.poster.avif?t=1755248105\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422590/extras/79561716b93e433892d0942cbbfb8ee0.webm?t=1755248105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422590/extras/79561716b93e433892d0942cbbfb8ee0.mp4?t=1755248105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The endless pursuit in the endgame</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00b7 Collect and strengthen your deck, adjust team strategies, head to key locations in JingHai City and engage in endless battles to protect the city's future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget to relax and enjoy daily life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Between adventures, don't miss the chance to experience the relaxing daily life. Mystery games from the pixel era, challenging score competitions... more casual gameplay awaits your participation.</p>",
    "short_description": "Amber of The End is a strategic card-based RPG. Dong Yue, about to start his second year of university, finds himself trapped in a time loop and reliving this unusual autumn.Meet intriguing friends, build unique card decks, defeat strong enemies, and find the truth hidden at the end of this autumn.",
